_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRz9Q1ZoGgL17Lrx8gpPFxcWNSE_KCSh_d_uHb4Cyh_oA&oe=6AF71EC0"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "1571742277663175", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_1571742280996508_3513047232396183741_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HJw3geSJAkgQ7kNvwHn0nvT&_nc_oc=AdrAp_bobdrEaCKk7-FrJa-gMdiRWzivOrjTWkdSwQSf8xp5sj3UWeJI5vJ229e6cj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTMqBqAhe8LS3uTp_tzyMOQlwotGAuehleF9_cltHZ7xg&oe=6AF73FD2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-09-28 163155 1.png", "id": "1068649679273248", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620669_1068649682606581_4749677360932108011_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pxJEXD_SziwQ7kNvwGqVkEC&_nc_oc=Adr9xufbZ_QKujWwUk9fz03lDjJPiK1Zq66YCuu5-C-Ibxmlsjwr84HZkCJTMJBPRvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9OB15z-feOu6AMKUe-dfEG8iFnq-eyIE_2Tp0aY3tEA&oe=6AF7256C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1664651702331023", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623601_1664651705664356_7791680538615226725_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tbUnLbmU_6YQ7kNvwH-UlIe&_nc_oc=Adr4WJi3P3lFA2kniqgWqYq5uTNXWHL_FDDgL6TcQ9Q88w7LKQAC877-sBHUPJALT2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTV5YPQoYI_oHu2rxCB08QJNqa3-Nm6Q8xcez5ZjwX5-Q&oe=6AF73E21"}, "display_name": "MixMaster VR", "keywords": ["dj", "rave", "social", "music", "livestream"], "long_description": "Mixmaster - Step Inside the Music\n The world's first VR home for electronic music. Your headset is your ticket.\nMixmaster turns your VR headset into a portal to the global EDM scene. Create your avatar, step onto a living dance floor with real people worldwide, and feel the drop like never before. \nNo ticket lines, no borders, no last call. Just you and the music, anytime.\nMove through massive arenas built for the beat, watch artists perform as their own avatars, and voice-chat with fans beside you in real time.\nWays to experience live music:\n \ud83c\udfb6 Virtual Concerts - live artist avatar shows with fans worldwide\n \ud83d\udce1 Live 360\u00b0 Streams - real-world events beamed into VR\n \ud83c\udfac 360\u00b0 Video Store - recorded 360\u00b0 events, watch on demand\n \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f VR Event Replicas - recreations of legendary shows, relive again\nThe music never stops. Jump into the FREE Main Arena - now gamified with a new venue: bowling and boxing arcade, plus tracks playing 24/7.\nWhat's inside Mixmaster:\n \ud83c\udfa7 FREE gamified Main Arena - bowling, boxing arcade & 24/7 music\n \ud83d\udd7a Fully customisable avatars\n \ud83c\udfa4 Live artist sets on virtual stages\n \ud83c\udf0d Real-time voice chat & multiplayer dancing\n \ud83d\udce1 Live 360\u00b0 streams of real-world events\n \ud83c\udfac 360\u00b0 video store to watch recorded events at anytime\n \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Stunning VR recreations of real events\n \ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f In-app tickets & exclusive access\n \ud83d\udd0a High-energy arenas built to feel every beat\nEDM fans, explorers, anyone who loves to dance - Mixmaster is your stage.\nDownload free and step inside music.", "short_description": "Step into the world's first VR home for electronic music. Dance with real fans from all over the world and watch artists perform live as their own avatars. Choose how you experience it, whether that's a Virtual Concert, a Live 360\u00b0 Stream, the new 360\u00b0 Video Store, or a VR Event Replica. Jump into the FREE Main Arena, now gamified with a new venue featuring bowling and a boxing arcade, plus tracks playing 24/7. Customise your avatar, grab tickets in app, and feel the drop like never before. \ud83c\udfb6"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mixmastervr.xyz/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Render Island", "support_w